type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"pvの中でも基本2人でわちゃわちゃ\nしてるので注目してみてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いpvになってると思うので\nぜひ見て頂きたいです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、通常盤には\n琴子、絢音、蘭世、れな、みり愛\n純奈の6人での楽曲「ボーダー」が\n収録されています！1人1人の歌声が\nしっかりと聞けると思うので、\nぜひ聞いてみてください♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握@京都ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は七瀬さんとペアでした(^｡^)\n七瀬さん推しの方ありがとう\nございました！！楽しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ボーダー初披露でした〜\n緊張したけど楽しかった(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\n次もがんばります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2015/03/23/3680567/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェキ会来て下さったみなさん\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/m